  "overview": "Canonical Vanilla — an extensible Sass CSS framework by the Ubuntu Web Team.",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fff) canvas paired with `#262626` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#0f95a1` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Ubuntu variable` across 4 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
